{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goat Survivor \u2013 Only the best strategies will ensure survival!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless waves of enemies and survive until the end with quick thinking and adaptability!<br>However, fighting alone won\u2019t be enough\u2014<strong>stand on the magic circle and stay there for a set time to claim victory!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Choose your character and upgrade their abilities!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from various characters with unique abilities and grow stronger over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up during battles and choose new skills to create your own combat style!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Change the flow of battle!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different skills to find the best strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide when to fight and when to move onto the magic circle to secure victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Survival strategies and resource management</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold during battles and use it to enhance your characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage special resources wisely, as each attempt offers new opportunities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Endless waves of enemies &amp; unpredictable bosses!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As stages progress, enemies become stronger, and unexpected bosses appear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single decision can mean victory or defeat!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your survival skills in <strong>Goat Survivor</strong>!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"'Lulu' Acquired!","path":"